{{Item|Forest Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used on [[Galatea]].

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Forest Essence}} can be be obtained in {{Zone|galatea}} in multiple ways:
* [[Tree Gifts]]
* [[Starlyn Contest]]s
* [[Salvaging#Forest|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Forest Essence}}.
